 # refused in seconds -- offline-gate/bdd (the tests) 40 of 55 failed jobs, the PR-body gates 9.
 # Mean 8 commits per merged PR, 7.2 min per CI run. This hook runs, in order:
+#   0. bin/idp-main-green-gate  on a new branch: refuses if main CI is red (founder 2026-09-17)
+#      bin/idp-wip-gate         on a new branch: refuses if >= 3 PRs are already failing (founder 2026-09-17)
 #   1. bin/idp-push-on-green   refuses a push to a branch whose PR is already green (2.2s measured)
 #   2. bin/pr-report           gitleaks over the lines this push adds, the estate-zone literals
 #                              among them, and the five content rules of policy/operating_model.rego.
@@ -22,6 +24,30 @@ IDP="$(cd "$(dirname "$0")/.." && pwd)"
